      },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "content": "La persistance, c'est le moment où un événement ne vit plus seulement dans Kafka ou dans la mémoire d'un service, mais devient une trace durable en base de données.\n\nCe dashboard sert à vérifier deux choses : ce qui a vraiment été écrit dans PostgreSQL et s'il existe un retard ou un écart entre le flux traité et le flux durable.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0",
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "simulpix-influxdb"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "persistence_gap_valid"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "écart validés Kafka => BDD"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "persistence_gap_rejected"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "écart rejetés Kafka => BDD"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "orange",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "simulpix-influxdb"
          },
          "query": "from(bucket: \"simulpix_observability\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"simulpix_platform\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._field == \"persistence_gap_valid\" or r._field == \"persistence_gap_rejected\")\n  |> aggregateWindow(every: v.windowPeriod, fn: last, createEmpty: false)\n  |> yield(name: \"last\")",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Écarts Kafka => BDD",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
